%% HotelSync - check-in, checkout and asynchronous reactions (2026-10-30)
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor R as Recepción
  participant FD as front-desk
  participant MQ as hotelsync.events
  participant HS as housekeeping
  participant BL as billing
  participant LO as loyalty
  participant AN as analytics

  MQ->>FD: booking.confirmed
  FD->>FD: upsert Arrival
  MQ->>BL: booking.confirmed
  BL->>BL: abre folio con cargo de habitación
  MQ->>LO: payment.completed
  LO->>LO: acredita puntos (idempotente por booking_id)
  Note over R,FD: check-in en recepción, solo si status = confirmed
  R->>FD: check-in (booking_id)
  FD->>MQ: checkout.completed + booking.completed (outbox)
  MQ->>HS: checkout.completed
  HS->>HS: room dirty + tarea pending
  MQ->>BL: checkout.completed
  BL->>BL: cierra folio, emite Invoice y folio.closed
  MQ->>LO: booking.completed (no-op idempotente)
  loop cada 6 h o manual
    AN->>AN: ETL lee réplicas read-only y hace upsert por hotel-día
    AN->>MQ: metrics.updated
  end
